string.py,chatbot/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/prompts/string.py,f9128147e2b1ae18c09f566a56b48f894cac65a6,davidcabrero/chatbot,https://api.github.com/repositories/888066580/contents/chatbot/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/prompts/string.py?ref=a9fc6817583ebd03768836d265828c16f68d096d,https://api.github.com/repositories/888066580/git/blobs/f9128147e2b1ae18c09f566a56b48f894cac65a6,https://github.com/davidcabrero/chatbot/blob/a9fc6817583ebd03768836d265828c16f68d096d/chatbot/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/prompts/string.py,"Web de asistente IA. DataBot, genera código, crea gráficos, genera imágenes, analiza archivos pdf, csv e imágenes, gestiona tus tareas y resuelve cualquiera de tus preguntas.",,0,0,0,56,2025-04-07T11:48:22Z,0,0,"# ChatBot de IA para Equipos de Analistas de Datos 📊
## Como Ejecutarlo en Visual 🛠️
#### Selecciona el entorno virtual y actívalo
```
chatbot\Scripts\activate
```
#### Instala las dependencias
```
pip install -r requirements.txt
```
#### Ejecuta la aplicación
```
streamlit run chatbot.py
```

## Funcionalidades 🤖

### 1. **Chatea con Chatbot**
Pregúntale cualquier cosa, habla con chatbot de todo.

### 2. **Genera Código**
Programa en cualquier lenguaje.

### 3. **Analiza Imágenes**
Sube una imagen y haz cualquier pregunta sobre ella.

### 4. **Genera Imágenes**
Crea cualquier imágen que tengas en tu cabeza con una descripción.

### 5. **Analiza Datos**
Crea gráficos y analiza los datos de archivos CSV.

### 6. **Analiza PDFs**
Haz cualquier pregunta sobre un pdf o pide resumirlo.

### 7. **Gestiona Tareas**
Crea tareas y asígnalas a personas con fecha de vencimiento, pregúntale al chatbot sobre ellas.

### 8. **Escucha las respuestas**
Puedes reproducir en audio las respuestas del chatbot.

### 9. **Genera PDFs**
Descarga la repuesta de DataBot en un pdf.

### 10. **Búsqueda en Internet**
Haz tus preguntas con búsqueda en la web.

### 11.. **Tools**
Herramientas de análisis de sentimiento, procesamiento de textos y detección de lenguaje, textos y similitudes...

### 12. **Scraping Web**
Haz preguntas sobre una web.

### 13. **Agentes**
Agentes IA especializados en diferentes ámbitos.
"
string.py,chatbot/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/prompts/string.py,f9128147e2b1ae18c09f566a56b48f894cac65a6,PavanAnish/Chatbot01,https://api.github.com/repositories/908555376/contents/chatbot/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/prompts/string.py?ref=0768087fec83f50508628e32cc399eb19bdb807c,https://api.github.com/repositories/908555376/git/blobs/f9128147e2b1ae18c09f566a56b48f894cac65a6,https://github.com/PavanAnish/Chatbot01/blob/0768087fec83f50508628e32cc399eb19bdb807c/chatbot/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/prompts/string.py,Test to learn!!,,0,0,0,3,2025-07-12T10:36:58Z,0,0,"Local AI Chatbot with Ollama
============================

A simple terminal-based chatbot powered by a local LLM using Ollama. It allows you to have natural conversations without relying on the internet or cloud APIs.

Features
--------
- Chat with an open-source language model (e.g., LLaMA3)
- Runs completely offline using Ollama
- Lightweight and easy to run
- Great for experimenting with LLMs locally

Technologies Used
-----------------
- Python
- Ollama (local LLM backend)

Setup Instructions
------------------
1. Install Python 3.8+
2. Install Ollama and run a model:
       https://ollama.com
       ollama run llama3

3. Clone this repo and navigate to the folder:
       git clone https://github.com/YourUsername/chatbot_ollama.git
       cd chatbot_ollama

4. Install dependencies (if any):
       pip install -r requirements.txt

5. Run the chatbot:
       python chatbot.py

Sample
------
> You: What is the capital of France?

> Bot: The capital of France is Paris.

Author
------
Built by Pavan V Anish

License
-------
MIT License
"
string.py,new_env/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/prompts/string.py,f9128147e2b1ae18c09f566a56b48f894cac65a6,MeghaSingh-5634/Content_Wizard_,https://api.github.com/repositories/893337183/contents/new_env/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/prompts/string.py?ref=13811ef5310b359e4f8df3235183311d649acbc0,https://api.github.com/repositories/893337183/git/blobs/f9128147e2b1ae18c09f566a56b48f894cac65a6,https://github.com/MeghaSingh-5634/Content_Wizard_/blob/13811ef5310b359e4f8df3235183311d649acbc0/new_env/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/prompts/string.py,,,0,0,0,12,2025-01-25T07:51:29Z,0,0,"# Content_Wizard
Welcome to Content Wizard, your one-stop solution for generating high-quality, tailored content with just a few clicks. Whether you’re a marketer, a blogger, or a student, this project helps you craft engaging titles, select platforms, customize content types, and optimize with keywords.

# Features
Interactive Interface: Choose from multiple options like platform, content type, and number of keywords.
Customizable Outputs: Generate content based on your specific requirements.
User-Friendly: A clean and intuitive design ensures a seamless experience

# Get Started
Clone the repository:
bash
Copy code
git clone https://github.com/YourUsername/Content_Wizard.git
cd Content_Wizard
Install dependencies:
bash
Copy code
pip install -r requirements.txt
Run the Streamlit application:
bash
Copy code
streamlit run app.py
Access the application in your browser at http://localhost:8501.

# Usage Instructions
Enter the title for which you want to generate content.
Select Platform: Choose your desired platform (e.g., Instagram,LinkedIn,etc).
Content Type: Specify the type of content you wish to generate(e.g., Captions,keywords,etc).
Select the maximum length for captions.
Select the maximum length for keywords.
Press ""Let's Go"" for output.
<br>

# Preview
