langchain_smartbucket_retriever.py,lm_raindrop_integrations/langchain_smartbucket_retriever.py,cecb447dd1202c4cf18fbe9d6b2ec3869b91abb3,LiquidMetal-AI/lm-raindrop-python-integrations,https://api.github.com/repositories/960100714/contents/lm_raindrop_integrations/langchain_smartbucket_retriever.py?ref=31342feb6903c3541be276ccf015cd5b1dd981ff,https://api.github.com/repositories/960100714/git/blobs/cecb447dd1202c4cf18fbe9d6b2ec3869b91abb3,https://github.com/LiquidMetal-AI/lm-raindrop-python-integrations/blob/31342feb6903c3541be276ccf015cd5b1dd981ff/lm_raindrop_integrations/langchain_smartbucket_retriever.py,This repository contains all integrations for the Raindrop platform,,0,0,2,3,2025-05-28T17:00:06Z,0,0,"# LiquidMetal Raindrop Integrations

Python SDK for integrating LiquidMetal's Raindrop API with popular frameworks and tools.

## Installation

Install the base package:

```shell
pip install lm-raindrop-integrations
```

## Supported Integrations

Raindrop SmartBuckets currently supports the following integrations:

### LangChain Retriever

Example usage with LangChain:

```python
from lm_raindrop_integrations import LangchainSmartBucketRetriever
import os

# Initialize the retriever
retriever = LangchainSmartBucketRetriever(
    api_key=""your-api-key"",  # or use RAINDROP_API_KEY env var
    bucket_name=""my-bucket""
)

# Search for documents
results = retriever.invoke(""What is machine learning?"")

# Process results
for doc in results:
    print(f""Content: {doc.page_content}"")
    print(f""Score: {doc.metadata['score']}"")
    print(f""Source: {doc.metadata['source']}"")
    print(""---"")
```


