# BlogCraftAI

BlogCraftAI is a full-stack AI-powered web application designed to simplify the process of content creation. Users can input a topic of their choice, and the app will generate a blog post based on selected tone, style, and complexity. Whether you're aiming for a casual tone, a formal style, or a complex structure, BlogCraftAI tailors the content to meet your needs.

## Features
User Authentication: Secure user login and registration.

Topic Input: Users can enter a topic for the blog post they want to generate.

Customization Options: Choose from various tones, styles, and levels of complexity to personalize the generated content.

Content Generation: AI-powered engine generates a complete blog post based on the user's preferences.

User Dashboard: Manage generated blog posts and keep track of your content including deletion of generated blogs.

## Tech Stack
Frontend: React, Vite

Backend: Django

Database: PostgresSQL 

LangChain(templates)

AI Model: Gemini

## Home page :
![Home](MyImages/home.png)

## User Blog Management :
![Management](MyImages/updatedblogs.png)

## Login page :
![Login](MyImages/login.png)

## Signup page :
![Signup](MyImages/signup.png)




## Contact Information
For support or inquiries, contact leankurtescano@gmail.com"
