```

#### Frontend (`.env.local`):

```env
VITE_OPENAI_KEY=your_openai_key
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000/api
```

#### Backend (`.env`):

```env
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_key
DATABASE_URL=your_mongo_url
SMTP_HOST=your_smtp_host
SMTP_PORT=your_port
EMAIL_USER=your_email
EMAIL_PASS=your_password
```

