## 🐳 Docker Setup (Optional)

### Backend Dockerfile
```dockerfile
FROM python:3.9-slim

WORKDIR /app
COPY requirements.txt .
RUN pip install -r requirements.txt

COPY . .
CMD [""uvicorn"", ""app.main:app"", ""--host"", ""0.0.0.0"", ""--port"", ""8000""]
```

### Frontend Dockerfile
```dockerfile
FROM node:16-alpine

WORKDIR /app
COPY package*.json ./
RUN npm install

COPY . .
RUN npm run build

FROM nginx:alpine
COPY --from=0 /app/dist /usr/share/nginx/html
```

---

