setup.py,pipeline/setup.py,b64af5c947b27b39af55cc872a68ef646cf3575b,Y4NK33420/manim_gen,https://api.github.com/repositories/1011366056/contents/pipeline/setup.py?ref=cdcda5ae80d8c7949339fdc1b8724f395679b088,https://api.github.com/repositories/1011366056/git/blobs/b64af5c947b27b39af55cc872a68ef646cf3575b,https://github.com/Y4NK33420/manim_gen/blob/cdcda5ae80d8c7949339fdc1b8724f395679b088/pipeline/setup.py,🎬 Transform natural language into professional educational Manim animations using fine-tuned LLMs and multi-agent AI pipeline. Full-stack platform with React/FastAPI and real-time video generation.,"ai, fastapi, langgraph, llm, manim, manim-animations, qwen2-5, typescript",0,0,0,2,2025-06-30T17:57:09Z,2,1,"# 🎬 Manim Animation Generation Platform

A comprehensive platform for generating Manim animations using AI, featuring a React frontend, FastAPI backend, fine-tuned models, and robust rendering pipeline. This system provides multiple interfaces for creating mathematical and educational animations through natural language instructions.

## 🌟 Platform Overview

This platform combines several powerful components:

- **🖥️ React Frontend**: Modern, responsive web interface with real-time progress tracking
- **🚀 FastAPI Backend**: Robust API server with WebSocket support for live updates  
- **🤖 AI Agent System**: Multi-stage pipeline for research, planning, coding, and rendering
- **🧠 Fine-tuned Models**: Custom SFT and reasoning models trained on Manim code
- **🎥 Rendering Engine**: Safe, isolated Manim code execution with error handling
- **📊 Real-time Pipeline**: WebSocket-powered progress tracking through all stages

## 🏗️ Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     🌐 Frontend (React + TypeScript)                │
│                     Real-time Progress • Video Preview               │
└─────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────┘
                          │ HTTP/WebSocket
┌─────────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     🚀 FastAPI Backend                              │
│                WebSocket Broadcasting • Pipeline API                │
└─────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────┘
                          │
┌─────────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    🤖 AI Agent Pipeline                             │
│     Research → Planning → Coding → Rendering → Composition          │
└─────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────┘
                          │
┌─────────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                   🎥 Manim Rendering Engine                         │
│               Safe Execution • Error Handling • Cleanup             │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## 📁 Project Structure

