```
root/
├─── .dvc/
|    ├── config                 # DVC core settings and remote storage
├─── .github/
|    ├── workflows/             # CI/CD workflows
├─── data-pipelines/            # Data preprocessing and pipeline scripts
|    ├── data-generation/       # Data Genaration DAG
