base.py,src/.venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain/retrievers/self_query/base.py,801990d1859ff2226285df7cea628d184c16bb58,deliverykodivianTeam/7-11-Website,https://api.github.com/repositories/979170062/contents/src/.venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain/retrievers/self_query/base.py?ref=c8de62699adc05a5311d5ca13fc8990d85377ea3,https://api.github.com/repositories/979170062/git/blobs/801990d1859ff2226285df7cea628d184c16bb58,https://github.com/deliverykodivianTeam/7-11-Website/blob/c8de62699adc05a5311d5ca13fc8990d85377ea3/src/.venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain/retrievers/self_query/base.py,,,0,0,0,75,2025-05-30T06:23:39Z,0,0,"# React + Vite

This template provides a minimal setup to get React working in Vite with HMR and some ESLint rules.

Currently, two official plugins are available:

- [@vitejs/plugin-react](https://github.com/vitejs/vite-plugin-react/blob/main/packages/plugin-react) uses [Babel](https://babeljs.io/) for Fast Refresh
