This project is a web application that allows users to upload an image of an invoice and extract information from it using Google's Generative AI model `gemini-1.5-flash`. The application is built with Streamlit for the web interface.

## Features

- Upload an image of an invoice in JPG, JPEG, or PNG format.
- Input a text prompt to guide the extraction process.
- Display the uploaded image.
- Extract and display information from the image based on the input prompt.

## Requirements

- Python 3.9 or higher
- Streamlit
- Pillow (PIL)
- python-dotenv
- google-generativeai


