#  Water RO AI Tool

[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-blue.svg)](LICENSE)
[![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/status-active-brightgreen)]()
[![Built With](https://img.shields.io/badge/built_with-Vue3-blue?logo=vue.js)]()
