  - [x] LLaMA-2
  - [x] BLOOM
  - [x] BLOOMZ
  - [x] Falcon
  - [x] Baichuan
  - [x] Baichuan2
  - [x] InternLM
  - [x] Qwen
  - [x] XVERSE
