# Request:

json
Copy code
POST /query
{
  ""query"": ""Summarize all payment terms from recent PDFs"",
  ""top_k"": 3
}

# Sample Response:

json
Copy code
{
  ""answer"": ""The most common payment terms include Net 30, due on receipt, and early-pay discounts...""
}

