## 🎯 Project Overview

This portfolio demonstrates proficiency in:
- **Machine Learning**: TensorFlow/Keras, LSTM networks, sentiment analysis
- **Natural Language Processing**: LangChain, RAG systems, document processing
- **Web Development**: Flask, Streamlit, responsive UI design
- **Database Management**: SQLite, MySQL, vector databases
