- Conversation history maintenance
- Configurable AI models and parameters

**Demo**: Upload documents and have natural conversations about their content

---

### 4. Enhanced AI Assistant Chatbot
**Tech Stack**: Streamlit, LangChain, OpenAI, Custom UI
**Description**: Multi-personality AI assistant with specialized roles

**Key Features**:
- Multiple assistant personalities (General, Microsoft, Technical, Creative)
- Dynamic temperature and token controls
- Conversation persistence
- Professional UI with real-time status indicators

**Demo**: Choose an assistant type and engage in specialized conversations

---

### 5. RAG Document Q&A System
**Tech Stack**: Streamlit, LangChain, Groq, FAISS, OpenAI Embeddings
**Description**: Advanced Retrieval-Augmented Generation system for document analysis

**Key Features**:
- Multi-document processing with progress tracking
- Groq LLM integration for fast responses
- Vector database creation and management
- Educational content focus with detailed explanations

**Demo**: Process research papers and ask complex questions about their content

---

### 6. Enhanced PDF Chat Assistant
**Tech Stack**: Streamlit, LangChain, Groq, Chroma, HuggingFace
**Description**: Conversational AI for PDF documents with chat history

**Key Features**:
- Multi-PDF processing with error handling
- Persistent conversation history
- Context-aware responses
- Modern UI with real-time feedback

**Demo**: Upload PDFs and maintain ongoing conversations about their content

---

### 7. Smart Research Assistant
**Tech Stack**: Streamlit, LangChain, ArXiv, Wikipedia, DuckDuckGo
**Description**: AI-powered research tool with multiple data sources

**Key Features**:
- Academic paper search via ArXiv
- Wikipedia and web search integration
- Document upload and analysis
- Search history and result caching

**Demo**: Ask research questions and get comprehensive answers from multiple sources

---

### 8. SQL Chat Agent
**Tech Stack**: Streamlit, LangChain, Groq, SQLite/MySQL
**Description**: Natural language to SQL query converter with database interaction

**Key Features**:
- Support for SQLite and MySQL databases
- Natural language query processing
- Pre-populated sample database
- Real-time SQL generation and execution

**Demo**: Ask questions in plain English and watch SQL queries get generated and executed

---

### 9. Smart Data Analysis Dashboard
**Tech Stack**: Streamlit, Plotly, Pandas, Seaborn, Groq AI
**Description**: Comprehensive business intelligence dashboard with AI insights

**Key Features**:
- Interactive data visualization with 7+ chart types
- AI-powered data analysis and insights
- Dashboard creation and management
- Support for multiple data sources

**Demo**: Upload datasets and create interactive dashboards with AI-generated insights

---

### 10. AI Customer Support System
**Tech Stack**: Flask, SQLite, SMTP, Groq/Ollama, CSV Integration
**Description**: Enterprise-grade customer support system with AI assistance

**Key Features**:
- Multi-LLM support (Groq/Ollama)
- Customer data management with SQLite
