1. Configure your book path
  ```
  Edit the config.json file to point to the correct book from books/tesseract_OCRed/ or Books_txt/.
  ```

2. Run REVERSUM
  ```
  python REVerSum.py
  ```
3. Results
  ```
  Enhanced sections are saved in results/
  ```

