  - [Amharic NanoGPT](#amharic-nanogpt)
  - [Neo4j Training](#neo4j-training)
  - [N-gram Model](#n-gram-model)
  - [Rejuve](#rejuve)
  - [Vector Search Engine](#vector-search-engine)
- [Usage](#usage)
- [Contributing](#contributing)
