## 🔧 Advanced Configuration

### Environment Variables (.env)
```bash
# AWS S3
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your_key
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your_secret
S3_BUCKET_NAME=hr-analytics-gepec

