### Model Customization
Modify parameters in `config/settings.py`:
```python
ML_CONFIG = {
    'salary_model': {
        'features': ['Age', 'Annees_Experience_Totale', ...],
        'test_size': 0.2,
        'random_state': 42
    },
    'turnover_model': {
        'n_estimators': 100,
        'max_depth': 10,
        ...
    }
}
```

## 📈 Main Features

### ✅ Synthetic Data Generation
